The MIT license above covers the source code in this repository only.

The law texts in data/corpus (and anything downloaded into data/raw) are
official legislation of the State of Qatar as published on Al Meezan
(almeezan.qa), the legal portal of the Ministry of Justice. They belong to
their publishers and are not licensed under MIT. English translations are
unofficial. See the "Data sources and terms" section of README.md.
